struggling to find a job.

01:30:09.696 --> 01:30:11.262
It's just bad out there.

01:30:12.901 --> 01:30:15.272
<i> A lot of people</i>
<i> are having a hard time,</i>

01:30:15.341 --> 01:30:17.800
<i> but you're going to be okay.</i>

01:30:17.869 --> 01:30:19.745
<i> I believe in you.</i>

01:30:19.813 --> 01:30:21.280
Thanks.

01:30:21.349 --> 01:30:24.141
<i> Why did you</i>
<i> lie before, though?</i>

01:30:24.209 --> 01:30:26.978
I don't know.
